 "If a salon needs to reschedule or cancel, you will be notified straight away and offered the next available slot or a full refund. You can cancel free of charge up to # hours before your appointment unless the salon states otherwise.": "Ako salon mora da pomeri ili otkaže termin, odmah ćete biti obavešteni i biće vam ponuđen prvi sledeći slobodan termin ili pun povraćaj novca. Termin možete besplatno otkazati najkasnije # sati pre početka, osim ako salon ne navede drugačije.",
 "By using Nova you agree to book appointments in good faith, to arrive on time and to respect each salon’s cancellation window. Prices and durations are set by the salon and shown before you confirm. Payments are processed securely and you will receive a receipt for every booking.": "Korišćenjem aplikacije Nova prihvatate da termine zakazujete u dobroj nameri, da dolazite na vreme i da poštujete rok za otkazivanje svakog salona. Cene i trajanje određuje salon i prikazuju se pre potvrde. Plaćanja se obrađuju bezbedno i za svaku rezervaciju dobijate potvrdu.",
 "Booking requests can be accepted or declined from the Bookings tab. Accepted requests are confirmed with the client automatically, and declined requests are released with a short message. You can change a response until the appointment starts. Declined requests free the time slot straight away.": "Zahtevi za rezervaciju mogu se prihvatiti ili odbiti na kartici Rezervacije. Prihvaćeni zahtevi se automatski potvrđuju klijentu, a odbijeni se zatvaraju uz kratku poruku. Odgovor možete da promenite dok termin ne počne. Odbijeni zahtevi odmah oslobađaju termin.",
 "By using Nova Business you agree to keep your services, prices and opening hours accurate, to confirm or decline booking requests promptly and to honour the cancellation window shown to clients. Client details are shared with you only to deliver the booked service. Booking requests can be accepted or declined from the Bookings tab. Accepted requests are confirmed with the client automatically, and declined requests are released with a short message. You can change a response until the appointment starts.": "Korišćenjem Nova Business prihvatate da ažurno vodite svoje usluge, cene i radno vreme, da blagovremeno potvrđujete ili odbijate zahteve za rezervaciju i da poštujete rok za otkazivanje prikazan klijentima. Podaci o klijentima dele se sa vama isključivo radi pružanja rezervisane usluge. Zahtevi za rezervaciju mogu se prihvatiti ili odbiti na kartici Rezervacije. Prihvaćeni zahtevi se automatski potvrđuju klijentu, a odbijeni se zatvaraju uz kratku poruku. Odgovor možete da promenite dok termin ne počne."
